</div>
<div class="row" style="margin-top:6px"><span class="label">فونت</span>
<div class="chips" id="fonts">
<button class="chip active" data-f="Vazirmatn">وزیرمتن</button>
<button class="chip" data-f="Lalezar">لاله‌زار</button>
<button class="chip" data-f="Estedad">استعداد</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">رنگ متن</span>
